ry tens of  millions in buying up bitcoin before the  price crashed  a one billion dollar bitcoin back bond  that he announced with much fanfare last  year has also been put on ice  it was all meant to help el salvador pay  its mounting foreign debts now  economists worry the country will  default so even as president buchelli's  supporters chanted for his re-election  on wednesday night  a moment of reckoning could be getting  closer  john holman al jazeera

